// that appeared at median step 126, blocking constrained generation for ~50% of examples.
//
// ATTEMPT 18 (BEST, 49% accuracy): Guidance DID include int() via "<<int(formula)>>",
// but guidance contained << → false RenderedEndsWith triggers from guidance text echoes.
// Also used exact `next == "<<"` token check (API violation; RenderedEndsWith is required).
